sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant App as Your app
  participant AS as Auth server
  participant API as Your API
  U->>App: Sign in
  App->>App: verifier, challenge = SHA256(verifier), state
  App->>U: redirect to /authorize<br/>client_id, scope, state, challenge
  U->>AS: log in + consent
  AS->>U: redirect to /callback?code&state
  U->>App: code + state (app checks state)
  App->>AS: POST /token: code + verifier
  AS-->>App: access, refresh, id tokens
  App->>API: Bearer access_token
  API->>API: verify signature (JWKS),<br/>iss, aud, exp, scope
  API-->>App: 200
